							'''
							A hood threaded with cosmic fibres
							+14% rogue damage and +8% rogue critical strike chance
							Enhances night vision and hastens stealth recovery
							'''
						SetBonus:
							'''
							Astral Convergence:
							- Summons three astral satellites that orbit and fire homing comets
