				}

				Chat: {
					Standard1: I've catalogued every component Magic Storage produces. Need some?
					Standard2: Proper calibration keeps storage containers from exploding. Buy them from me.
					PostMech: Those mechanical troublemakers made me reinforce every storage container twice.
					PostMoonLord: Lunar fragments make exquisite storage conduits. Try the luminite upgrades!
				}

				Bestiary: A tinkerer obsessed with spatial compression, selling spares for the Magic Storage network once you've proven yourself.

				TownNPCMood: {
					Content: I am content.
					NoHome: I hate not having a home.
					FarFromHome: I am too far from home.
					LoveSpace: I love having so much space.
					DislikeCrowded: I dislike how crowded I am.
					HateCrowded: I hate how crowded I am.
